   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f7c5832b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Modelo\n",
    "\n",
    "Entrenamos y comparamos dos modelos no supervisados sobre `df_final`: **DBSCAN** y **Isolation Forest**. Ambos se optimizan con Optuna (20 pruebas cada uno, `TPESampler` con semilla fija) maximizando el *silhouette score* de las etiquetas resultantes (cluster vs. ruido/anomalía)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "445ed7c6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Modelo DBSCAN"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d6969c4a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Optimización de hiperparámetros"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 19,
   "id": "23bd01e5",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-08-09T21:51:41.956020Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-08-09T21:51:41.955739Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-08-09T21:51:41.962095Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-08-09T21:51:41.960318Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def objective_dbscan(trial):\n",
    "    params_dbsc = {\n",
    "        'eps': trial.suggest_float('eps', low=0.1, high=3.0),\n",
    "        'min_samples': trial.suggest_int('min_samples', low=2, high=50)\n",
    "    }\n",
    "\n",
    "    model_dbsc_trial = DBSCAN(**params_dbsc)\n",
    "    labels_trial = model_dbsc_trial.fit_predict(df_final)\n",
    "\n",
    "    n_clusters = len(set(labels_trial)) - (1 if -1 in labels_trial else 0)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Si no hay al menos 2 clusters reales (sin contar ruido), no se puede calcular silhouette\n",
    "    if n_clusters < 2:\n",
    "        return -1  # peor score posible, para que Optuna descarte esta combinación\n",
    "\n",
    "    score_trial = silhouette_score(df_final, labels_trial)\n",
    "\n",
    "    return score_trial"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 20,
   "id": "ae67b5af",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-08-09T21:51:41.964910Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-08-09T21:51:41.964612Z",
